<div class="mwsbodytext text parbase section">
    

    
        <div><div>&nbsp;</div>
<section class="container"><p>The Major Projects Office (MPO) is&nbsp;advancing projects of national interest faster and responsibly to help connect our economy, diversify our industries and trade, and create hig<span class="nowrap">h-pa</span>ying careers for generations to come. Working alongside provincial, territorial and Indigenous partners, we are unlocking Canada’s economic potential, while respecting our environmental responsibilities and the rights of Indigenous Peoples.</p>
<p><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/about-us.html">Learn more about the MPO (Major Projects Office)</a></p>
</section><div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>

    


</div>
