<div class="mwsmediaplayer section">

    <div>
  <section class="container gc-features">
    <h2>Driving growth</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 100%">Learn how Canada is using all the tools as its disposal to get major infrastructure projects built at speeds not seen in generations. </p>
    <div class="row wb-eqht-grd" style="margin-bottom: 10px">
      <div class="col-sm-4 hght-inhrt" style="margin-bottom: 20px">
        <div class="eqht-trgt hght-inhrt" style="background-color: #234c46; color: white"> <img src="/content/dam/pco-bcp/mpo-bgp/home/priorities/MPO_OurPriorities_01_ProjectsAndTransformativeStrategies_360x160.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="">
          <div style="padding: 20px">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px"><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/our-priorities/projects-transformative-strategies.html" style="color: white"><span style="color: white">Projects and transformative strategies</span></a></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 100%; margin-bottom: 0px">Learn about the 18&nbsp;projects and 8&nbsp;transformative strategies we currently support.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-4 hght-inhrt" style="margin-bottom: 20px">
        <div class="eqht-trgt hght-inhrt" style="background-color: #234c46; color: white"> <img src="/content/dam/pco-bcp/mpo-bgp/home/priorities/MPO_OurPriorities_02_SimplifyingCanadasProcess_360x160.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="">
          <div style="padding: 20px">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px"><a href="/en/one-canadian-economy/services/simplifying-canada-process.html" style="color: white" target="_blank"><span style="color: white">Simplifying Canada’s process for major projects</span></a></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 100%; margin-bottom: 0px">Learn how the Government of Canada is working to improve Canada’s project reviews and decision-making processes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-4 hght-inhrt" style="margin-bottom: 20px">
        <div class="eqht-trgt hght-inhrt" style="background-color: #234c46; color: white"> <img src="/content/dam/pco-bcp/mpo-bgp/home/priorities/MPO_OurPriorities_03_PartneringWithIndigenousPeoples_360x160.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="">
          <div style="padding: 20px">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px"><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/partnering-indigenous-peoples.html" style="color: white"><span style="color: white">Partnering with Indigenous Peoples</span></a></h3>
            <p style="font-size: 100%; margin-bottom: 0px">Learn how we are building lasting prosperity and creating new economic opportunities with Indigenous Peoples.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>


</div>
<div class="mwsmediaplayer section">

    <div style="background-color: #e9efdc">
  <div>&nbsp;</div>
  <section class="container">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <h3><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/advancing-nation-building-projects.html" style="color: black"><span style="color: black">Identifying projects of national interest</span></a></h3>
    <p style="font-size: 100%">We work with proponents, federal departments, provinces and territories, Indigenous Peoples, and industry to help identify projects that offer the greatest benefits for Canadians.</p>
    <div style="background-color:  #234c46; height: 3px">&nbsp;</div>
    <h3><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/advancing-nation-building-projects.html#1" style="color: black"><span style="color: black">Submitting project information</span></a></h3>
    <p style="font-size: 100%">We accept proposals for major projects including ports, railways, energy corridors, critical mineral developments, and clean energy initiatives, among others, to be considered as projects of national interest.</p>
    <div style="background-color:  #234c46; height: 3px">&nbsp;</div>
    <h3><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/advancing-nation-building-projects.html#2" style="color: black"><span style="color:black">Evaluating projects</span></a></h3>
    <p style="font-size: 100%">We assess projects against the five factors  outlined in the <em><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/one-canadian-economy/services/building-canada-act-projects-national-interest.html">Building  Canada Act</a></em>, among others, and provide recommendations and advice to  federal ministers and the Prime Minister.</p>
    <div style="background-color:  #234c46; height: 3px">&nbsp;</div>
    <h3><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/supporting-proponents.html" style="color: black"><span style="color: black"><abbr title="Major Projects Office">MPO</abbr> supports</span></a></h3>
    <p style="font-size: 100%">We provide varied support to projects based on the project type, status and unique requirements.</p>
  </section>
  <div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>


</div>
<div class="mwsmediaplayer section">

    <div>
  <div>&nbsp;</div>
  <section class="container">
    <h2 class="h3">Projects listed under the <em>Building Canada Act</em></h2>
    <p>In addition to other  support, the&nbsp;<em>Building Canada Act</em>&nbsp;is one option we may  recommend for projects that would benefit from regulatory streamlining.</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/one-canadian-economy/services/building-canada-act-projects-national-interest.html">Listing under  the&nbsp;<em>Building Canada Act</em></a>&nbsp;will help advance select major projects  deemed to be of national interest by conditionally approving them to further  streamline federal review and approval processes.</p>
  </section>
  <div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>


</div>
<div class="mwsmediaplayer section">

    <div>
  <section class="container gc-features">
    <h2>Latest announcements</h2>
    <div class="row wb-eqht-grd" style="margin-bottom: 10px">
      <div class="col-md-8 hght-inhrt">
        <div class="eqht-trgt hght-inhrt" style="background-color: white">
          <div style="border: 3px solid #e1e1e1; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 90%">October 1, 2026</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 110%"><a href="https://www.pm.gc.ca/en/news/news-releases/2026/10/01/prime-minister-carney-lists-west-coast-oil-pipeline-now-known-pacific" target="_blank">Prime Minister Carney lists the West Coast Oil Pipeline, now known as Pacific Link, as a project of national interest to unlock Canada’s full potential as a global energy superpower</a></p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: 3px solid #e1e1e1; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 90%">September 29, 2026</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 110%"><a href="https://www.pm.gc.ca/en/news/news-releases/2026/09/29/prime-minister-carney-welcomes-lng-canada-phase-2-second-largest" target="_blank">Prime Minister Carney welcomes LNG Canada Phase 2, the second-largest single private investment in Canadian history</a></p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: 3px solid #e1e1e1; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 90%">September 28, 2026</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 110%"><a href="/en/transport-canada/news/2026/09/canada-and-alberta-to-collaborate-on-high-speed-rail.html" target="_blank">Canada and Alberta to collaborate on High-Speed Rail</a></p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: 3px solid #e1e1e1; padding: 10px;">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 90%">August 28, 2026</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 110%"><a href="/en/one-canadian-economy/news/2026/08/canada-takes-next-step-in-potential-listing-of-mackenzie-valley-highway-and-roberts-bank-terminal-2-projects-under-building-canada-act.html" target="_blank">Canada takes next step in potential listing of Mackenzie Valley Highway and Roberts Bank Terminal&nbsp;2 projects under <em>Building Canada Act</em></a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 hght-inhrt">
        <div class="eqht-trgt hght-inhrt" style="background-color: #234c46; color: white; padding: 25px">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="mwsbodytext text parbase section"> <img src="/content/dam/pco-bcp/mpo-bgp/home/1-redesign/MPO_Logo_EN.svg" alt="" class="visible-sm visible-md visible-lg"> </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="mwsbodytext text parbase section"> </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h2 class="h4">The Major Projects Office is ready to work with you</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 100%">Our team consults with federal departments, provinces and territories, Indigenous partners, and stakeholders, to streamline the review process and align with Canada’s priorities.</p>
          <p style="font-size: 100%"><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/contact-us.html" style="color: white"><span style="color: white">Contact us</span></a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p><a href="/en/privy-council/major-projects-office/news.html">All news about One Canadian Economy</a></p>
  </section>
</div>


